{"server":"cn","storyId":"act11d0_level_act11d0_08_end","groupId":"act11d0","stageId":"act11d0_08","title":"月光沉沦","storyCode":"TW-8","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"7fad0f0ce6a569ded89d4512873bca040be1a652e77d6e970e2a33d9daaf96a9","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"苦战以塞弗林的突入终结，塞弗林试图以死平息动乱，却被罗德岛制止。泥岩改变了自己的想法，平息了战斗。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"九尾狐活动 8下"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"负伤的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——长官，你在这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"负伤的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"听说你负伤了，你可以下地了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳，这里伤员很多......再这样下去，真的没地方落脚了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"塔佳娜......塔佳娜她怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"负伤的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我也不清楚，听说有人在她的面前被烧死，她就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜......呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"........哭出来吧，孩子，你没必要强撑着的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"对、对不起......但是我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"去哭一场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"可现在外面还是一片混乱！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"我去......有我在，还有罗德岛的各位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"总有办法的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"不......您难道是想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"带她去休息，我来指挥战局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"负伤的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"伯父......！答应我！不要去送死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"那是没有意义的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......连你都说出没有意义这种话，那可就真没有意义了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"至少怀着点希望吧......也许事情还有转机。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"给我——让开！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"成功了！那些巨像，巨像被粉碎了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"这种执着......真是出乎预料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"泥岩，不该这么手下留情了，否则我们无法全身而退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......你眼中满是仇恨，和茫然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"你在为安托医生感到愤怒，可那又如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"这里每个人背负的东西，都不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"住嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"不许你......提她的名字。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"等到饥荒和寒冬来临，你们还是会战败，这是一场无人生还的闹剧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"沃伦姆德......会灭亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"这不用你说！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"你在恨谁......？你又想救谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃！又是那个法术——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岩石巨像","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊啊啊啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"亚叶姐姐——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"减缓了泥岩的法术生效时间......真是奇异的技巧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，你还有余裕分心？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！放、放开我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你应该庆幸，如果你再大个几岁，我会毫不犹豫地砍下你持杖的惯用手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"——铃兰！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"别想跑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岩石巨像","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊啊啊啊——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......你只是个医生，你不该背对敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"塞弗林——！你还不能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"又一个......战士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......真凶，已经被找到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"造成这一切的元凶！叛徒毕德曼！就在刚才，已经被罗德岛的干员们带回了议事厅！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，毕德曼......毕德曼没死？那是怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"不要听他胡言乱语！真凶是谁还重要吗！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"我们要的是感染者不再被非感染者排挤，穷人不必为贵族卖命！冬灵人可以夺回自己的土地！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是整合运动——我们将开启新的时代——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，塞弗林，这毫无用处......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......那就杀了我，整合运动，我们痛痛快快打一场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......然后呢？寒冬和饥荒依旧可以摧毁这座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"反正横竖都是死路一条......我宁可相信罗德岛可以阻止事情变得更糟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"至少能多活下来一些人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，你遍体鳞伤，面罩都碎了一半，你的巨像分崩离析，你其实很累了，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"我看得出来......我们同病相怜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"——呃，借个火？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"反正这都是最后一根烟了......算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"（动手，现在，不要让他们有机会救我。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"——塞弗林·霍索恩，你死后，我会撤离这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"这只是一座几近荒废的城镇，留在这里，只是等死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"你的死，给他们交代。如若他们还想残害他人，我自会处置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......这就够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"——永别。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......这法术，这是什么力量......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"——您、您为什么......一定要送死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"让开，小姑娘！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"您不该死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"那就会有更多人死——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！泥岩好像遇到麻烦了！赶紧去帮他！不要让他们喘息！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"但、但他们连巨像都能打碎......这也太......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"断崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"......乖乖放弃吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"断崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"连萨卡兹都失败了，你们还要靠什么战斗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"——啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"断崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"如果只是乘机发泄不满的话......好啊，我奉陪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"断崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"我们奉陪到底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"快，快启动剩下的“留声机”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我不懂莱塔尼亚的源石技艺，快去找个莱塔尼亚人......慢着，头顶那是什么，无人机！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"别看头顶！看你背后！有个眼睛通红的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡达","speakerId":"char_328_cammou","isRemote":false,"text":"......劝你们别乱动哦，灰喉姐可是盯着你们的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡达","speakerId":"char_328_cammou","isRemote":false,"text":"哎......也别回头去找灰喉姐的位置，我也盯着你们啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们愤怒，你们保护。这是第几次了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......呵，你们居然真的赢了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"把武器放下，这次不会放水了，泥岩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......你们这样会让他们依旧记恨沃伦姆德！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"与任何立场都无关，他们并非真正渴求变革，他们只是把自己的利益凌驾于其他人之上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"因为他们没有选择共渡难关，也不愿意知晓真相，他们只想要......在混乱中掠夺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"塔佳娜小姐说的对，即使你牺牲自己，也是徒劳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"不管背后的问题多么复杂，罗德岛的干员绝不会坐视感染者......毁掉一座城镇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......一座安托想要保护的城镇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛的行动小队将死守这处广场，这座议事厅大楼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"的确，也许这会造成更多的伤亡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"但那是在这之后，在“你们”，和“我们”之后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"只要我们还在，就必须抗争到最后一刻......为了让安托，瞑目。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者们","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们，确实战胜了我......也许你们确实可以死守这座塔楼......但意义是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"很多人都会死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"会像安托一样......死得毫无意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者有抗争的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"理由永远会被正当化......但至少现在，你们没有在解决问题，你们只是在破坏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"在沃伦姆德遭受天灾之后，在补给告急缺乏人手的现在......你们做了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我啊，你们做了什么！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"——我说过了，别动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"你的源石技艺已经漏洞百出，现在这个距离，即使只是我的弩箭也足够让你失去行动能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"是什么导致了那场火灾，那场火灾又导致了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......罪魁祸首，已经死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......是吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"——我们撤退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者们","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？但我们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"我说了，撤退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"只是小部分的人的话......有办法穿过大裂谷，回到温暖的地带。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"无论你们是想要夺回土地还是报复富人......最后都只会在冻土上遇难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"你们是想靠怒火度过冬天，还是想靠无辜者的尸体生火取暖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"既然真凶已死，那么我们理应撤退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"但、但我们要抢夺的是沃伦姆德！是我们的土地！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴，冬灵人。你想要的只是权利，舒舒服服地躲在强者后面捡破烂的权利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"不要质疑领袖，学聪明点，否则就把你丢在废土上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"......这不是你一句话就能解决的！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"我们死了这么多人！难道就因为几句话就要夹着尾巴离开吗！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......让他安静，朋友们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"嘎嗷嗷嗷——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"唔啊——唔啊啊啊——这——拳头——！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"从地底伸出的石拳......你还有余力吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"不要用这么过激的手段制止他们，至少刚才为止他们和我们还是一边的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"我本来只想吓他们一下的......算了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你也别老是把自己的源石技艺造物叫做朋友啊，瘆得慌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......你可以当没听见。别这么啰嗦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"听着，撤退是我的判断。我没有命令你们所有人的能力，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"我会离开。愿意跟随我的人也会离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的人......你们自求多福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"对了......你有火柴吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"如果没受潮的话，刚才那几个术师可真麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"给那边的塞弗林长官，递个火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"战败者......能活着退出战场，已是万幸，不要再磨蹭了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁！那就不要管什么整合运动了！打下议事厅是迟早的事，这座城镇需要我们做主——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"投降吧，塞弗林！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......我就说，他们不会轻易收手的，咳咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"注意左侧！他们来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，躲在我身后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......一群疯子，啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"绝对，不允许你们，践踏罗德岛保护的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"他们在准备施法，准备防御，击破施术者——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什么？挡下了我的源石技艺？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"你们为什么要来碍事——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"——领袖有令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"就算要和你们打，我们也不会轻易放弃，魔族！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......嚯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"发生什么了，他们怎么起了内讧......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......泥岩他......停下了脚步？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"领袖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......土壤啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"站......起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"停下，泥岩，你在缩短自己的寿命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......无所谓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"没必要使用那么古老的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"我说了......站起来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"几乎所有的废墟都凝结在一起。\n那是一个巨人，它遥望着远方的山脉。\n他，泥岩，一动不动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好高！好大！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......强弩之末罢了，它的身躯在崩溃，他在勉强自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"后退，不要贸然进攻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不对......泥岩的确已经没有这个力气了，但是这法术......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"这其中有着萨卡兹的......巫术？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"（我说了——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岩石巨像","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我说了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你在做一件很危险的事情，你把你的生命分享给了自己的造物，如果只是为了威慑，这不值得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......行吧，听你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"（从仇恨和纷争里脱身，活下去，现在是离开这里的最后机会。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岩石巨像","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"离开这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"（还想战斗的人......就是想将所有人置于死地。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岩石巨像","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那么......先来摧毁我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"先来打败......我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"他、他怎么......他不是来帮我们的人吗！他不是整合运动吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"......我、我才不管！那就让他去死吧！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"过去......我们帮助你们。因为那场火灾，我们都心怀愤懑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我们认同你们，引导你们，我们追求的不是他们的死，而是我们的生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"很遗憾，现在，我们似乎不站在同一边了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......杀害平民和罗德岛的战士，让我们心有忧虑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果是对付不听命令的暴徒......我们何必手下留情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"对付任何人，我们，萨卡兹，“魔族佬”，都绰绰有余。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"绰绰有余。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"断崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"发生什么了？自从那个巨像出现之后，声音就停下了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡达","speakerId":"char_328_cammou","isRemote":false,"text":"那个、山一样的巨像也是源石技艺吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"断崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"......想办法和亚叶她们汇合。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘁！该死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"走，我们走，这座城镇已经死了，在冬天来临前找到翻过大裂谷的路才能活下去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"放弃这座城镇吧，冬灵的同胞，穷人和感染者们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"自会有别处迎接我们的怒火，就让沃伦姆德坐以待毙吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"......在这里和萨卡兹冲突也没有任何好处，撤退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"我们走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"泥岩，够了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"呼啊——哈、哈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"他们已经停手了......真荒唐，我们怎么变成了劝架的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"看看这座城镇......我们，带来了混乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"非你我本意，但抗争本就是利己的，没有那么多人心怀什么伟大事业。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"你说的对......那我们究竟要如何对待我们的斗争......以及死去的同胞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"痛苦和纠葛时刻伴随着我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，等我一下......我好像摸着火柴了，备用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，宪兵，接着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......萨卡兹的战士也会抽烟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"不过我已经戒烟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"唔嗯，看来每个戒烟的人都会带着火柴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......捡来的命，好好珍惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"至于你们，罗德岛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......那么，就此别过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"也许......也许你们能想办法帮助剩下的这些人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"但那些事，都和萨卡兹无关了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在岩石的崩塌声中，萨卡兹们转过了头。\n街道在燃烧。\n暴徒离去，没有再发生冲突的唯一原因，仅仅是恐惧和威慑。\n最后一块碎石落地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_294_ayer","aliases":["断崖"]},{"speakerId":"char_328_cammou","aliases":["卡达"]},{"speakerId":"char_345_folnic","aliases":["亚叶"]},{"speakerId":"char_358_lisa","aliases":["铃兰"]},{"speakerId":"char_367_swllow","aliases":["灰喉"]}]}
